harrison wagner remembered by his  brother and girlfriend just days after  his untimely death  [Music]  jack and christina wagner's 27 year old  son was found dead in a parking lot on  monday in los angeles and in the wake of  the tragedy his loved ones are paying  tribute on social media harrison's older  brother peter shared a series of photos  from their childhood to instagram the  brothers posing together as kids in  similar outfits  plus some snaps of harrison in his high  school football uniform and practicing  his golf swing the caption a simple  message always with you as for  harrison's on and off girlfriend actress  sophia bowie she's also grieving  and showing her love in a lengthy post  sophia calls her tribute a love letter  to her late beau and says she's so  brokenhearted  seven years on and off round and round  we loved each other for better or for  worse in sickness and in health  sophia apologizes for missing some late  night phone calls from harrison in the  days leading up to his death and writes  that she misses sleeping in his quote  polar bear arms i was never alone in  this world with you you were the balm  that soothed my soul you were my guy i  hope that i was that comfort for you i  will always be your babe i will always  choose to love you in this world and in  any other life  harrison's parents jack and christina  have yet to speak out publicly the  former couple who met while co-starring  on general hospital divorced in 2006  after 13 years of marriage  despite their split harrison seemed to  spend a lot of time with both his mom  and dad last month christina shared  photos from a trip to their family ranch  along with the hashtags peter and  harrison love my sons  all right  [Music]  and in march harrison shared a selfie  with his look-a-like pops the caption  fittingly like father like son  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

